  "contract": [
    "Preserve packet pointer/length guards, scalar low-byte capture, four-service order, log field read order, fresh timestamps and post-provider reloads.",
    "Clock timezone is zero-extended; event publication uses unsigned absolute difference strictly greater than30, or changed timezone.",
    "Hour multicast preserves the stock scalar argument word and zero cleanup event. No address-of-local reinterpretation.",
    "Daily fixture and get-dispatch declarations now describe the pointer consumed in R0; their machine objects are unchanged.",
    "Activity and stress consumer lengths are ignored by the actual consumers; comparison excludes unused R1 at those boundaries."
  ],
  "limits": [
    "Providers are modeled in direct callback comparisons. The separate7200-case chain executes actual C callback, connection-presence predicate, charge packet and response-header helper; charger queries, handle getter and final response transport remain modeled. The gate does not establish authentication.",
    "Raw stock is pinned and all20 REA instruction ranges agree with it. All700 callback instruction bytes execute across the direct corpus. Source execution cannot enter stock; modeled providers return through BX LR instructions.",
    "Compare call arguments, packet snapshots and read width/order; preserve saved integer/FP registers, SP, masks and guards. Exclude void R0, caller scratch, APSR and private stack addresses. Unmapped accesses are logical access-shape checks, not physical fault proof.",
    "Retain callback425b0 assembly because its implicit incoming R2/R3 fallback record contract is unresolved. Retain the42724 string-interior assembler alias. Neither is claimed converted.",
    "No new persistent state or imports.864 other nongenerated source/object pairs unchanged, and the two corrected provider declaration objects unchanged. Existing generated startup and uecc objects differ as expected.",
    "The first full build failed on a pre-fix volatile-pointer warning; only the clean final report is admitted. Early fixture oracle and audit bookkeeping failures were corrected without further production changes.",
    "Full build is relocatable composition, not final executable/startup or boot proof. Physical sensor, charger, flash and BLE delivery and remaining hardware dependencies remain open. No instruction or image identity is claimed."
  ],
